      "First, the algorithm rewards consistency between profile and content, so the first few sharp posts are surfaced disproportionately. Second, the engagers are themselves filtered for the niche, so the resulting audience is denser with qualified buyers. Third, decision-makers reading the feed are more likely to follow up with someone whose entire profile signals this is what they do.",
      "## The verified human video bonus",
      "LinkedIn now gives priority to content marked as verified human upload, particularly video, over text posts and external links. B2B decision-makers are reported to be around 75 percent more likely to engage with founder-led video than with traditional corporate ads. A weekly short video where you talk to camera about a specific niche topic outperforms a longer written post on the same topic.",
      "## Six content patterns for niche experts",
