      "## What does not work in 2026",
      "Generic motivational content does not work. Listicles without a point of view do not work. Reposted content with a caption does not work. Posts that mix topics from outside your profile alignment do not work. The discipline is to write only inside the niche even when you have interesting things to say outside it.",
